# Sekaigent — Project Overview

Sekaigent ("sekai" = world + agent) is a secret-agent mission game on **0G Mainnet**.

Players are masters of secret agents (ERC-7857 Agentic IDs). They accept admin-created missions from a stylized world map lobby, submit sealed MissionPlays, compete for prize-pool rankings, and audit public reasonings after mission close.

## MVP scope

- Map as world lobby (no tile movement)
- Admin-only missions
- ERC-7857 ownership + ERC-8004 discoverability; ENS deferred
- Commit–reveal criteria + structured MissionPlay + rubric grader
- Network: 0G Mainnet only (chain ID 16661)

## Out of scope

Tile exploration, player-created missions, ENS, marketplace UI, live agent↔evaluator chat, protocol fee, complex skill trees, testnet.
